ructures. The 2026 TrueDOP distinguishes their open cross ties, inner rooms and planted parts. The rooftop structure rings on Taylor Wessing and Magenta Mitte and the deck levels are orthophoto- and image-guided fits; the original seven envelopes and 45 voxel columns are retained as evidence."}}
